## The brief
RAP Roofing and Building needed a credible online presence to compete in local search and convert visitors into paying customers.

## What we built
A clean, professional website with dedicated service pages, a gallery of completed work, and a prominent contact form — built with local SEO at its core.

## Results
- Improved visibility in local roofing and building searches
- Professional platform that builds trust with potential customers
- Consistent flow of enquiries through the website

NC Digital builds professional websites for roofing and building contractors in [Caerphilly](/web-design-caerphilly/) and across South Wales.
